WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.407 --> 00:00:03.924
Unit two. Mental Health Support Systems!

2
00:00:04.883 --> 00:00:09.709
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:12.688
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.738 --> 00:00:17.609
Today we learn about Mental Health Support Systems. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:23.295
Support system. Say it with me. Support system!

6
00:00:26.747 --> 00:00:30.631
Counselor. Say it with me. Counselor!

7
00:00:34.125 --> 00:00:38.125
Peer support. Say it with me. Peer support!

8
00:00:41.650 --> 00:00:45.950
Crisis line. Say it with me. Crisis line!

9
00:00:49.436 --> 00:00:53.852
Early intervention. Say it with me. Early intervention!

10
00:00:57.350 --> 00:01:02.666
Community resource. Say it with me. Community resource!

11
00:01:06.154 --> 00:01:11.987
Self-advocacy. Say it with me. Self-advocacy!

12
00:01:15.516 --> 00:01:19.916
Recovery plan. Say it with me. Recovery plan!

13
00:01:23.394 --> 00:01:41.830
A strong support system might include a school counselor, peer support, or a crisis line during a hard time. Early intervention and using a community resource can prevent a small problem from growing. Self-advocacy helps build a personal recovery plan.

14
00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:45.284
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:46.015 --> 00:01:51.213
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:51.263 --> 00:01:52.518
Peer support!

17
00:01:53.568 --> 00:01:58.945
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:58.995 --> 00:02:00.520
Self-advocacy!

19
00:02:01.806 --> 00:02:11.357
Did you know? Many countries have a free, confidential crisis helpline available 24 hours a day for anyone who needs support.

20
00:02:11.407 --> 00:02:13.959
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:14.818 --> 00:02:24.599
Think and answer. What support systems are available to students at your school?

22
00:02:24.649 --> 00:02:25.813
Great answer!

23
00:02:26.785 --> 00:02:32.303
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:32.353 --> 00:02:35.245
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

